{"seq":1,"slug":"pretraining-objectives","title":"预训练目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/pretraining-and-alignment/pretraining-objectives","wordCount":1051,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"预训练目标\">预训练目标</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预训练目标决定了模型「学什么」，本篇的几个核心概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自监督学习</strong>：不需要人工标注，直接从文本自身构造监督信号，这是能利用数万亿 token 的前提。</li>\n<li><strong>CLM（因果语言建模）</strong>：从左到右逐个预测下一个 token，用因果掩码保证位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 只能看到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>…</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\dots t-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，是 GPT/LLaMA/Qwen 的预训练目标。</li>\n<li><strong>MLM（掩码语言建模）</strong>：随机掩盖约 15% 的 token 让模型还原，是 BERT 的目标，擅长理解但不擅长生成。</li>\n<li><strong>下一个 token 预测</strong>：看似简单的任务，实际蕴含语法、语义、逻辑推理与世界知识的学习信号。</li>\n<li><strong>困惑度（Perplexity）</strong>：交叉熵损失的指数形式，用来直观衡量模型的语言建模水平。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者分工清晰：<strong>CLM 给生成能力，MLM 给理解能力，而下一个 token 预测是 CLM 的载体</strong>——不同目标决定了模型的能力特点和适用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语言建模范式\">语言建模范式</h2><p>预训练是大语言模型获得通用语言能力的核心阶段。模型在海量文本数据上通过自监督学习，掌握语法、语义和世界知识。不同的预训练目标决定了模型的能力特点和适用场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 预训练目标&#10;        CLM[&quot;因果语言建模 CLM&lt;br/&gt;预测下一个 token&quot;]&#10;        MLM[&quot;掩码语言建模 MLM&lt;br/&gt;预测被掩盖的 token&quot;]&#10;        S2S[&quot;序列到序列&lt;br/&gt;编码器-解码器&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    CLM --&gt; GPT[&quot;GPT, LLaMA, Qwen&quot;]&#10;    MLM --&gt; BERT[&quot;BERT, RoBERTa&quot;]&#10;    S2S --&gt; T5[&quot;T5, BART&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 预训练目标\n        CLM[\"因果语言建模 CLM&lt;br/&gt;预测下一个 token\"]\n        MLM[\"掩码语言建模 MLM&lt;br/&gt;预测被掩盖的 token\"]\n        S2S[\"序列到序列&lt;br/&gt;编码器-解码器\"]\n    end\n    CLM --&gt; GPT[\"GPT, LLaMA, Qwen\"]\n    MLM --&gt; BERT[\"BERT, RoBERTa\"]\n    S2S --&gt; T5[\"T5, BART\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"因果语言建模-clm\">因果语言建模（CLM）</h2><p>因果语言建模（Causal Language Modeling）是当前主流 LLM 的预训练目标。模型从左到右逐个预测下一个 token，每个位置只能看到它之前的 token：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n) = \\prod_{t=1}^{n} P(x_t | x_1, \\dots, x_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;vocab_size = 32000&#10;seq_len = 10&#10;logits = torch.randn(1, seq_len, vocab_size)&#10;&#10;target = torch.randint(0, vocab_size, (1, seq_len))&#10;&#10;loss = F.cross_entropy(&#10;    logits.view(-1, vocab_size),&#10;    target.view(-1)&#10;)&#10;print(f&quot;CLM 损失: {loss.item():.4f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;probs = F.softmax(logits[0, -1], dim=-1)&#10;next_token = torch.argmax(probs)&#10;print(f&quot;预测的下一个 token ID: {next_token.item()}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vocab_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">seq_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, seq_len, vocab_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vocab_size, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, seq_len))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.cross_entropy(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    logits.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vocab_size),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CLM 损失: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss.item()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">probs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.softmax(logits[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">next_token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.argmax(probs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"预测的下一个 token ID: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">next_token.item()</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CLM 使用因果掩码确保模型在预测位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时只能关注位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 因果掩码&#10;        direction TB&#10;        T1[&quot;token₁ → 可见: 无&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;token₂ → 可见: token₁&quot;]&#10;        T3[&quot;token₃ → 可见: token₁, token₂&quot;]&#10;        T4[&quot;token₄ → 可见: token₁, token₂, token₃&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 因果掩码\n        direction TB\n        T1[\"token₁ → 可见: 无\"]\n        T2[\"token₂ → 可见: token₁\"]\n        T3[\"token₃ → 可见: token₁, token₂\"]\n        T4[\"token₄ → 可见: token₁, token₂, token₃\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> CLM 的核心优势是生成能力——模型天然学会了如何续写文本。这也是为什么 GPT 系列能够出色完成对话、写作等生成任务。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"掩码语言建模-mlm\">掩码语言建模（MLM）</h2><p>掩码语言建模（Masked Language Modeling）是 BERT 的预训练目标。随机掩盖输入中约 15% 的 token，让模型预测被掩盖的部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import random&#10;&#10;def create_mlm_data(token_ids, mask_prob=0.15, vocab_size=30522, mask_token_id=103):&#10;    labels = token_ids.clone()&#10;    masked_indices = torch.bernoulli(&#10;        torch.full(token_ids.shape, mask_prob)&#10;    ).bool()&#10;&#10;    labels[~masked_indices] = -100&#10;&#10;    input_ids = token_ids.clone()&#10;    replace_mask = torch.bernoulli(torch.full(token_ids.shape, 0.8)).bool() &amp; masked_indices&#10;    input_ids[replace_mask] = mask_token_id&#10;&#10;    random_mask = torch.bernoulli(torch.full(token_ids.shape, 0.5)).bool() &amp; masked_indices &amp; ~replace_mask&#10;    random_tokens = torch.randint(0, vocab_size, token_ids.shape)&#10;    input_ids[random_mask] = random_tokens[random_mask]&#10;&#10;    return input_ids, labels&#10;&#10;tokens = torch.randint(100, 30000, (1, 20))&#10;masked_input, labels = create_mlm_data(tokens)&#10;print(f&quot;原始 token 数: {(labels != -100).sum().item()}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_mlm_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(token_ids, mask_prob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vocab_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30522</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, mask_token_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">103</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token_ids.clone()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    masked_indices </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.bernoulli(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        torch.full(token_ids.shape, mask_prob)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ).bool()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    labels[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">~</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">masked_indices] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    input_ids </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token_ids.clone()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    replace_mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.bernoulli(torch.full(token_ids.shape, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).bool() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> masked_indices</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    input_ids[replace_mask] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask_token_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    random_mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.bernoulli(torch.full(token_ids.shape, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).bool() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> masked_indices </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ~</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">replace_mask</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    random_tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vocab_size, token_ids.shape)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    input_ids[random_mask] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random_tokens[random_mask]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input_ids, labels</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">masked_input, labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> create_mlm_data(tokens)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原始 token 数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).sum().item()</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>比例</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>替换为 [MASK]</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>标准掩码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替换为随机 token</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>增加鲁棒性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保持不变</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>防止偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"下一个-token-预测的本质\">下一个 Token 预测的本质</h2><p>下一个 token 预测（Next Token Prediction）看似简单，实际上蕴含了极其丰富的学习信号。模型需要理解语法、语义、逻辑推理甚至世界知识才能准确预测：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 预测所需能力&#10;        A[&quot;语法知识&lt;br/&gt;The cat ___ on the mat → sat&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;语义理解&lt;br/&gt;The capital of France is ___ → Paris&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;逻辑推理&lt;br/&gt;If x &gt; 5 and x &lt; 10, then x is ___ → between 5 and 10&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;世界知识&lt;br/&gt;Water boils at ___ degrees → 100&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A &amp; B &amp; C &amp; D --&gt; E[&quot;都通过预测下一个 token 学到&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 预测所需能力\n        A[\"语法知识&lt;br/&gt;The cat ___ on the mat → sat\"]\n        B[\"语义理解&lt;br/&gt;The capital of France is ___ → Paris\"]\n        C[\"逻辑推理&lt;br/&gt;If x &gt; 5 and x &lt; 10, then x is ___ → between 5 and 10\"]\n        D[\"世界知识&lt;br/&gt;Water boils at ___ degrees → 100\"]\n    end\n    A &amp; B &amp; C &amp; D --&gt; E[\"都通过预测下一个 token 学到\"]</pre><p>随着模型规模增大，下一个 token 预测损失的降低与模型能力的提升高度相关：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>困惑度 (Perplexity)</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>大致能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt; 100</td>\n<td>随机猜测</td>\n<td>无意义输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20-50</td>\n<td>基本语法</td>\n<td>语句通顺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10-20</td>\n<td>良好语义</td>\n<td>连贯文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt; 10</td>\n<td>深层理解</td>\n<td>高质量生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"预训练数据\">预训练数据</h2><p>预训练数据的质量和多样性直接决定模型的能力上限。现代 LLM 的预训练数据通常包含数万亿 token：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>代表数据集</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网页文本</td>\n<td>Common Crawl, C4, FineWeb</td>\n<td>量大，需严格过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>书籍</td>\n<td>Books3, Gutenberg</td>\n<td>高质量长文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码</td>\n<td>GitHub, The Stack</td>\n<td>编程能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学术论文</td>\n<td>ArXiv, S2ORC</td>\n<td>专业知识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>百科</td>\n<td>Wikipedia</td>\n<td>结构化知识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对话</td>\n<td>Reddit, Forums</td>\n<td>交互能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"data_composition = {&#10;    &quot;网页文本&quot;: 60,&#10;    &quot;代码&quot;: 15,&#10;    &quot;书籍&quot;: 10,&#10;    &quot;学术论文&quot;: 5,&#10;    &quot;百科&quot;: 5,&#10;    &quot;其他&quot;: 5,&#10;}&#10;&#10;for source, pct in data_composition.items():&#10;    bar = &quot;█&quot; * (pct // 2)&#10;    print(f&quot;{source:8s} {pct:3d}% {bar}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data_composition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"网页文本\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"代码\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"书籍\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"学术论文\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"百科\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"其他\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source, pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_composition.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"█\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:8s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:3d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">% </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数据预处理流程通常包括：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;原始数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;去重&lt;br/&gt;MinHash&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;质量过滤&lt;br/&gt;启发式规则&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;有害内容过滤&lt;br/&gt;分类器&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;分词&lt;br/&gt;Tokenizer&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;打包序列&lt;br/&gt;拼接/截断&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;训练数据&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"原始数据\"] --&gt; B[\"去重&lt;br/&gt;MinHash\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"质量过滤&lt;br/&gt;启发式规则\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"有害内容过滤&lt;br/&gt;分类器\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"分词&lt;br/&gt;Tokenizer\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"打包序列&lt;br/&gt;拼接/截断\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"训练数据\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 数据质量比数据数量更重要。经过精心策划的高质量数据可以让更小的模型超越在低质量数据上训练的大模型。FineWeb-Edu 等经过教育质量过滤的数据集就是典型例子。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CLM（因果语言建模）是当前主流 LLM 的预训练目标，通过下一个 token 预测学习语言能力。</li>\n<li>MLM（掩码语言建模）适合编码器模型，擅长理解任务但不适合生成。</li>\n<li>下一个 token 预测看似简单，实际上隐含了语法、语义、推理和世界知识的学习。</li>\n<li>预训练数据的质量、多样性和规模共同决定了模型的能力上限。</li>\n<li>数据预处理（去重、过滤、清洗）是预训练成功的关键环节。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预训练目标","id":"预训练目标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"语言建模范式","id":"语言建模范式"},{"level":2,"text":"因果语言建模（CLM）","id":"因果语言建模-clm"},{"level":2,"text":"掩码语言建模（MLM）","id":"掩码语言建模-mlm"},{"level":2,"text":"下一个 Token 预测的本质","id":"下一个-token-预测的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"预训练数据","id":"预训练数据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分词与嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/foundations/tokenization-and-embedding"},"next":{"title":"缩放定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/pretraining-and-alignment/scaling-laws"}}